luegrass\" style ？ The radio program \"Hit Parade\" is launched 1935 ？ Woody Guthrie writes the Dust Bowl Ballads…"}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Inventor of Bluegrass","body":"Bill Monroe is widely recognized as the \"inventor of Bluegrass\" music. Carl Perkins was a \"massive fan\" of Monroe, who was known for his distinctive high, driving, and harmony-filled songs of longing. \"Carl was a massive fan of the inventor of Bluegrass, Bill Mundo, who sang high, driving, harmony-filled songs of longing.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","episode":"Episode 36: \"Blue Suede Shoes\" by Carl Perkins","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TItMbEioi7Y"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":6779152621276,"type":"album","name":"Knee Deep in Blue Grass","list_id":276702392435984,"list":"RYM Top — Country — Bluegrass","src":"musthear","rank":127,"year":1958,"note":null,"yt":"bZLSOmeNkfg","scaruffi":null},{"id":6779152621276,"type":"album","name":"Knee Deep in Blue Grass","list_id":60739539139006,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Traditional Bluegrass","src":"musthear","rank":15,"year":1958,"note":null,"yt":"bZLSOmeNkfg","scaruffi":null},{"id":6779152621276,"type":"album","name":"Knee Deep in Blue Grass","list_id":59502452022900,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Traditional Country","src":"musthear","rank":62,"year":1958,"note":null,"yt":"bZLSOmeNkfg","scaruffi":null},{"id":214886791866728,"type":"album","name":"I Saw the Light","list_id":29400011212191,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Bluegrass Gospel","src":"musthear","rank":2,"year":1959,"note":null,"yt":"BBXwQ0Y4sec","scaruffi":null},{"id":214886791866728,"type":"album","name":"I Saw the Light","list_id":226395167427913,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Country Gospel","src":"musthear","rank":16,"year":1959,"note":null,"yt":"BBXwQ0Y4sec","scaruffi":null},{"id":214886791866728,"type":"album","name":"I Saw the Light","list_id":60739539139006,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Traditional Blueg